sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Manager
    participant A as Architect
    participant E as Engineer
    participant Q as QA
    M->>A: Provide bounded feature scope
    A->>Q: Share implementation approach and risks
    Q->>E: Provide focused validation contract
    E->>Q: Deliver change set and test updates
    Q->>M: Report proof result or targeted rework
    M->>M: Produce parent-ready handoff
